WEBVTT

20:04.870 --> 20:06.496
Who is that woman with the D.A.?

20:09.416 --> 20:10.584
Why, for Stiles?

20:11.168 --> 20:14.963
That's what she said,
but I.A.D. never plays it straight.

20:15.047 --> 20:17.299
Any of us on this investigation
could get jammed.

20:21.094 --> 20:22.429
I gotta go see Yamaguchi.
